  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CRDB Bank Plc is the leading provider for financial services in Tanzania with operations in both Tanzania and Burundi, East Africa. CRDB offers a comprehensive range of corporate, retail, business, treasury, and wholesale microfinance services through a network of 120 branches.It was established in 1996 and was listed on the Dar Es Salaam Stock exchange (DSE) in June 2009. It has a 20 per cent market share in Tanzania.</narrative>
  </description>
